              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "veṟṟi peṟa namakku oru putiya utti tēvai. — We need a new strategy to win.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *veṟṟi peṟa namakku oru putiya utti tēvai.* — We need a new strategy to win.]"
